    DOT  shift, and go to state 1573

    FROM      reduce using rule 274 (class_name)
    FROM      [reduce using rule 542 (delete_name)]
    USING     reduce using rule 274 (class_name)
    USING     [reduce using rule 542 (delete_name)]
